{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead is a third-person action-challenge game where you control various test subjects submitted to extreme reflex, coordination, and timing experiments. Set in a clinical, sterile lab environment, the game places you in a series of deadly rooms designed to make you fail \u2014 or force you to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.poster.avif?t=1766560154\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.webm?t=1766560154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.mp4?t=1766560154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage simulates a different phase of a brutal experiment: pixel-perfect jumps, timed traps, moving lasers, rotating blades, and collapsing platforms create a relentless testing ground for both body and mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COOP</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.poster.avif?t=1766560154\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.webm?t=1766560154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/846b392f07127cb7a69672e35f40bf7c.mp4?t=1766560154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face extreme experiments in cooperative mode. Synchronization, timing and decision-making as a duo are essential, as any failure compromises both. Survival depends on collective precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Mercy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.poster.avif?t=1766560154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.webm?t=1766560154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/10d1c827e29df455a267c89326c3c584.mp4?t=1766560154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nerion tolerates no failure. Any mistake means immediate elimination, with a single strike. Behind the tests lies a relentless pursuit of peak reflexes and physical agility, ignoring any ethical limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are being watched</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.poster.avif?t=1766560154\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.webm?t=1766560154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/6f4408821f01b5628c902be6c82b735e.mp4?t=1766560154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by whom?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874300?t=1766560154","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/d2dea535a13f2869f832be4de4bbaccc8afff0ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766560154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/f5ebff6bc952bb323174764430975379b04b13f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766560154","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/f5ebff6bc952bb323174764430975379b04b13f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766560154","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains traps along the path that kill the player in a violent manner."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3887870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go ahead is a third-person action-challenge game where you control various test subjects submitted to extreme reflex, coordination, and timing experiments. Set in a clinical, sterile lab environment, the game places you in a series of deadly rooms designed to make you fail \u2014 or force you to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874300/extras/1c5682e3e9fb3ef4091bd4c27fd25872.poster.avif?t=1766560154\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it